# Docker 构建上下文排除项：避免把依赖、构建产物与本地密钥打进镜像
.git
.gitignore
.github
docs
device_app
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
web/dist
web/.vite
web/*.local
logs
data
.run
infra/prod/.env
infra/prod/secrets
infra/prod/nginx/certs
infra/mosquitto/passwd
infra/mosquitto/passwd.tmp
infra/mosquitto/data
*.db
*.sqlite3
